                                &lt;h3 className={styles.asideTitle}&gt;What you get&lt;/h3&gt;
                                {[&apos;Personalised career roadmap&apos;, &apos;1-on-1 specialist call&apos;, &apos;Tailored job search strategy&apos;, &apos;Resume &amp; LinkedIn review tips&apos;, &apos;Salary benchmarking insights&apos;].map(item =&gt; (
